  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your charming words and enchanting gaze can enthrall another creature. As a Magic action, choose one creature you can see within 10 feet of you. If it can see or hear you, it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC or have the Charmed condition for 1 minute, or until it is more than 10 feet away from you, can neither see nor hear you, or takes damage. While Charmed this way, the target has the Incapacitated condition and a Speed of 0. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
